  "goodToKnow": "Die Unwissenheit is ignorance, lack of knowledge: aus Unwissenheit handeln. The proverb Unwissenheit schützt vor Strafe nicht means ignorance of the law is no excuse. Unwissend means unknowing or ignorant. Die Ignoranz is a similar word but suggests wilful ignorance or arrogance. Das Wissen is knowledge, and Wissen ist Macht (knowledge is power). It has no plural."
